        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int themis::performance::phase4::IoUringZeroCopyIO::send_zerocopy</definition>
        <argsstring>(int fd, uint32_t buf_index, size_t len) noexcept</argsstring>
        <name>send_zerocopy</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::performance::phase4::IoUringZeroCopyIO::send_zerocopy</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>fd</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>uint32_t</type>
          <declname>buf_index</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>size_t</type>
          <declname>len</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Enqueue a zero-copy send of <computeroutput>len</computeroutput> bytes from pre-registered buffer at index <computeroutput>buf_index</computeroutput>. The caller must have written <computeroutput>len</computeroutput> bytes into get_buffer(buf_index).data() before calling this.</para>
<para>On io_uring: submits an IORING_OP_SEND with IORING_RECVSEND_FIXED_BUF. On fallback: calls send() immediately and increments fallback_sends.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>0 on success (io_uring submission or fallback), -errno on error. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
