        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int themis::performance::phase4::IoUringZeroCopyIO::recv_zerocopy</definition>
        <argsstring>(int fd, uint32_t buf_index, size_t max_len) noexcept</argsstring>
        <name>recv_zerocopy</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::performance::phase4::IoUringZeroCopyIO::recv_zerocopy</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>fd</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>uint32_t</type>
          <declname>buf_index</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>size_t</type>
          <declname>max_len</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Enqueue a receive into pre-registered buffer at index <computeroutput>buf_index</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>On io_uring: submits an IORING_OP_RECV with IORING_RECVSEND_FIXED_BUF. On fallback: calls recv() immediately and increments fallback_recvs.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>number of bytes received on fallback, 0 on io_uring queue, -errno on error. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
